        <mxCell id="raw_icon" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" value="📝 Raw User Input" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="200" x="90" y="44.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="raw_text" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#cccccc;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(204, 204, 204), rgb(62, 62, 62));&quot;&gt;This is a policy about how inventory is &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(204, 204, 204), rgb(62, 62, 62));&quot;&gt;counted and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(204, 204, 204), rgb(62, 62, 62));&quot;&gt;reconciled at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(204, 204, 204), rgb(62, 62, 62));&quot;&gt;the end of the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(204, 204, 204), rgb(62, 62, 62));&quot;&gt;fiscal year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(204, 204, 204), rgb(62, 62, 62));&quot;&gt;1. Each warehouse conducts a physical count&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(204, 204, 204), rgb(62, 62, 62));&quot;&gt;2. The count gets compared against the system records&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(204, 204, 204), rgb(62, 62, 62));&quot;&gt;3. Any discrepancies get investigated and documented&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(204, 204, 204), rgb(62, 62, 62));&quot;&gt;4. Adjustments get submitted to the finance office for&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(204, 204, 204), rgb(62, 62, 62));&quot;&gt;review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(204, 204, 204), rgb(62, 62, 62));&quot;&gt;5. The finance office reviews and posts the adjustments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(204, 204, 204), rgb(62, 62, 62));&quot;&gt;before the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(204, 204, 204), rgb(62, 62, 62));&quot;&gt;reporting deadline&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(204, 204, 204), rgb(62, 62, 62));&quot;&gt;6. Final inventory numbers get reported up&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(204, 204, 204), rgb(62, 62, 62));&quot;&gt;This should follow SFFAS xx for inventory &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(204, 204, 204), rgb(62, 62, 62));&quot;&gt;valuation and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(204, 204, 204), rgb(62, 62, 62));&quot;&gt;SFFAS xx&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(204, 204, 204), rgb(62, 62, 62));&quot;&gt;for how costs get recognized during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(204, 204, 204), rgb(62, 62, 62));&quot;&gt;reconciliation process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="220" width="300" x="90" y="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
