        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="explain_text" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="- One raw input produces two optimized outputs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Context rewrite gives downstream agents clean, structured output&lt;div&gt;with important information which doesn&#39;t get repeated by future&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;agents.&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Search optimization extracts intent and keywords tuned for&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;the search algorithm used so searches are more likely to return&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;relevant documents&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- These rewrites are commonly used to optimize the language used&lt;br&gt;by LLMs to make there output better for other LLMs to read&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160.5" width="300" x="90" y="359.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
